    "text": "The People's Study\n*The opinions expressed by the hosts and guests in this show are not necessarily the views of Children’s Health Defense.\nMy Daughter Died After Covid Shot - Kimberly Budzon\nJan 22, 2025\nKim’s daughter, Alexis, was pursuing a degree in nursing when the COVID shots rolled out. Concerned about safety, “she held off until the last possible minute” until the mandates were put into place, at which point “she knew she was going to have to be vaccinated.” In this account, Kim Buzdon provides the alarming details on what happened to ‘Lexi’ after the injections and how it led to her painful demise. Watch the interview on CHD.TV.",
